---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Alure.ai terms of service - terms and conditions for using our platform." noindex={true}>
  <style>
    .legal-content .container {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .legal-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .legal-header p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .legal-section h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
      color: #333;
    }

    .legal-section p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-section ul {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-left: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-section li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #555;
    }

    .highlight-box {
      background: #f0f9ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .highlight-box h4 {
      color: #6366f1;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .contact-info {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .contact-info h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #6366f1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .legal-header h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <main class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>Terms and conditions for using Alure.ai services</p>
      </div>

      <div class="last-updated">
        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 1, 2024
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>Welcome to Alure.ai ("we," "our," or "us"). These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of our AI-powered call script generation and sales automation platform ("Service"). By accessing or using our Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>
        <p>If you disagree with any part of these terms, then you may not access the Service.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <h4>Important Notice</h4>
        <p>By using Alure.ai, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Alure.ai provides an AI-powered sales automation platform that includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Automated prospect research and data analysis</li>
          <li>AI-generated personalized call scripts</li>
          <li>Call performance tracking and analytics</li>
          <li>Campaign management and optimization tools</li>
          <li>CRM integrations and workflow automation</li>
          <li>Team collaboration and reporting features</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Our Service is designed to enhance your sales calling process through artificial intelligence and automation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Account Registration and Security</h2>
        
        <h3>3.1 Account Creation</h3>
        <p>To use our Service, you must:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information</li>
          <li>Maintain and update your account information</li>
          <li>Be at least 18 years old or the age of majority in your jurisdiction</li>
          <li>Have the legal authority to enter into these Terms</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3.2 Account Security</h3>
        <p>You are responsible for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials</li>
          <li>All activities that occur under your account</li>
          <li>Notifying us immediately of any unauthorized use</li>
          <li>Using strong passwords and enabling two-factor authentication</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        
        <h3>4.1 Permitted Uses</h3>
        <p>You may use our Service for legitimate business purposes, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Sales prospecting and lead generation</li>
          <li>Customer relationship management</li>
          <li>Business development activities</li>
          <li>Team training and performance improvement</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.2 Prohibited Uses</h3>
        <p>You may not use our Service to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Send spam, unsolicited, or illegal communications</li>
          <li>Harass, abuse, or harm another person</li>
          <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
          <li>Distribute malware or harmful code</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer or attempt to access our source code</li>
          <li>Use the Service for competitive analysis or to build competing products</li>
          <li>Violate telemarketing laws or Do Not Call registries</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Subscription Plans and Billing</h2>
        
        <h3>5.1 Subscription Plans</h3>
        <p>We offer various subscription plans with different features and usage limits. Plan details and pricing are available on our website and may be updated from time to time.</p>

        <h3>5.2 Billing and Payment</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Subscription fees are billed in advance on a recurring basis</li>
          <li>All fees are non-refundable except as expressly stated</li>
          <li>You authorize us to charge your payment method automatically</li>
          <li>You're responsible for keeping payment information current</li>
          <li>We may suspend service for non-payment</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>5.3 Plan Changes and Cancellation</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>You may upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time</li>
          <li>Changes take effect at the next billing cycle</li>
          <li>You may cancel your subscription at any time</li>
          <li>Cancellation prevents future billing but doesn't provide refunds</li>
          <li>Your data remains accessible until the end of your billing period</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Data and Privacy</h2>
        
        <h3>6.1 Your Data</h3>
        <p>You retain ownership of all data you upload or create using our Service. We process your data solely to provide our services as described in our Privacy Policy.</p>

        <h3>6.2 Data Security</h3>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including encryption, access controls, and regular security audits.</p>

        <h3>6.3 Data Backup and Export</h3>
        <p>We regularly backup your data and provide data export functionality. You're responsible for maintaining your own backups of critical data.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        
        <h3>7.1 Our IP Rights</h3>
        <p>The Service and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by Alure.ai and are protected by international copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.</p>

        <h3>7.2 Your Content</h3>
        <p>You retain ownership of content you create or upload. By using our Service, you grant us a limited license to process your content to provide our services.</p>

        <h3>7.3 AI-Generated Content</h3>
        <p>Content generated by our AI systems (such as call scripts) is provided to you for your use, but we retain rights to the underlying AI technology and algorithms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Service Availability and Support</h2>
        
        <h3>8.1 Service Uptime</h3>
        <p>We strive to maintain 99.9% uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. We may perform maintenance that temporarily affects availability.</p>

        <h3>8.2 Support</h3>
        <p>We provide customer support through various channels including email, chat, and phone (for certain plans). Support response times vary by plan level.</p>

        <h3>8.3 Service Modifications</h3>
        <p>We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our Service at any time. We'll provide reasonable notice for significant changes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>OUR LIABILITY IS LIMITED TO THE AMOUNT YOU PAID FOR THE SERVICE IN THE 12 MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM</li>
          <li>WE ARE NOT LIABLE FOR INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES</li>
          <li>WE DO NOT GUARANTEE SPECIFIC RESULTS FROM USING OUR SERVICE</li>
          <li>YOU USE THE SERVICE AT YOUR OWN RISK</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your use of the Service</li>
          <li>Your violation of these Terms</li>
          <li>Your violation of any third-party rights</li>
          <li>Any content you upload or create using the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>11. Termination</h2>
        
        <h3>11.1 Termination by You</h3>
        <p>You may terminate your account at any time by canceling your subscription or contacting us.</p>

        <h3>11.2 Termination by Us</h3>
        <p>We may terminate or suspend your account if you:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Violate these Terms</li>
          <li>Fail to pay subscription fees</li>
          <li>Use the Service in a way that harms us or other users</li>
          <li>Provide false information</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>11.3 Effect of Termination</h3>
        <p>Upon termination:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your access to the Service will cease</li>
          <li>You may download your data for 30 days</li>
          <li>We may delete your data after the retention period</li>
          <li>These Terms remain in effect for outstanding obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>12. Compliance and Legal Use</h2>
        
        <h3>12.1 Telemarketing Compliance</h3>
        <p>When using our Service for calling activities, you must:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Comply with all applicable telemarketing laws</li>
          <li>Respect Do Not Call registries</li>
          <li>Obtain proper consent for communications</li>
          <li>Maintain required calling records</li>
          <li>Honor opt-out requests immediately</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>12.2 Data Protection</h3>
        <p>You must comply with applicable data protection laws (GDPR, CCPA, etc.) when using our Service, including obtaining necessary consents for data processing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>13. Dispute Resolution</h2>
        
        <h3>13.1 Governing Law</h3>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>

        <h3>13.2 Arbitration</h3>
        <p>Any disputes will be resolved through binding arbitration in San Francisco, California, rather than in court, except for claims that may be brought in small claims court.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>14. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make changes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>We'll post the updated Terms on our website</li>
          <li>We'll update the "Last Updated" date</li>
          <li>We'll notify you of significant changes via email</li>
          <li>Your continued use constitutes acceptance of the new Terms</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>15. Miscellaneous</h2>
        
        <h3>15.1 Entire Agreement</h3>
        <p>These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and Alure.ai.</p>

        <h3>15.2 Severability</h3>
        <p>If any provision of these Terms is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions will remain in effect.</p>

        <h3>15.3 Assignment</h3>
        <p>You may not assign these Terms without our consent. We may assign these Terms in connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets.</p>

        <h3>15.4 No Waiver</h3>
        <p>Our failure to enforce any provision of these Terms does not constitute a waiver of that provision.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>16. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> legal@alure.ai<br>
        <strong>Address:</strong> Alure.ai, Inc.<br>
        123 Legal Street, Suite 100<br>
        San Francisco, CA 94105<br>
        <strong>Phone:</strong> 1-800-ALURE-AI (1-800-258-7324)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
